## Ideologram Integration
## Mobile Support (P1)

- Orientation Prompt: shows on home in portrait with rotate/preview options; remembers choice per session.
- Safe-Area Insets: top HUD, center pane, bottom HUD account for iOS notches via CSS env() variables.
- Drawers: left/right sidebars convert to mobile drawers on xs/sm with edge openers, overlay-to-close, and swipe gestures.
- Touch tuning: passive listeners; long-press pins tooltip; globe hover sampling throttled to frame.
- Tooltips: clamped within center pane and below top HUD.


- Composer: `features/ideologram/IdeologramView` assembles CSV upload, ChatGPT history upload, enrichment, and compression.
- Enrichment: `features/ideologram/enrichment/enhancedEnrichBook.js` (exported via `features/ideologram/enrichment/index.js`).
- File previews updated in left sidebar (`library.json`, `enriched.json`, `compressed.json`).

## MCP Tasks/Bugs and Fallback

- MCP client: `src/shared/agents/mcpClient.js`
  - Tasks helpers: `tasks.heartbeat`, `tasks.lock.request`, `tasks.status.update`, `tasks.plan.updated`, `tasks.breaking_change`, `tasks.pr.opened`.
  - Todos/Bugs helpers: `tasks.todo.open|update|close`, `bugs.open|update|close`, `tasks.linked`, `tasks.note`.
- Fallback when MCP unavailable:
  - Mirror to `context/tasks.yaml` and append changes to `context/CHANGELOG.log`.
  - CLI: `scripts/mcp-task.js` (e.g., `npm run mcp-task -- open-task "Title"`).

